OL,3,ALib Dems demand action over increase in
OL,4,Achild birth injuries
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government must not ignore a
OL,7,F"national safety scandal" in maternity
OL,8,Fservices, Liberal Democrat leader Sir
OL,9,FEd Davey has said, as figures suggest
OL,10,Flife-altering childbirth injuries in
OL,11,FEngland have reached record levels.
OL,13,FLib Dem analysis of NHS figures showed
OL,14,Fthe number of women suffering
OL,15,Fpotentially life-threatening levels of
OL,16,Fblood loss is the highest ever recorded
OL,17,Fin England.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
