OL,3,ALib Dems demand action over increase in
OL,4,Achild birth injuries
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree in every 100 women suffered
OL,7,Fserious tearing injuries requiring
OL,8,Femergency surgery in the first half of
OL,9,Fthis year, something Sir Ed said was a
OL,10,F"devastating indictment of our NHS
OL,11,Fmaternity services".
OL,13,FThe government is expected to publish a
OL,14,Fnew national maternity and neonatal
OL,15,Faction plan by the end of the year.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
